    "title": "Cohesion & Coupling",
    "kind": "concept",
    "difficulty": "Core",
    "statement": "Aim for HIGH cohesion (a class’s parts belong together) and LOW coupling (classes barely depend on each other). It’s the master dial behind every other principle.",
